{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "7c1e4a2b-9d30-4f6a-b8e1-auth-rwa-backoffice",
    "name": "RWA Backoffice — Auth",
    "description": "Contrato de Auth para el frontend del backoffice.\n\nBase: `{{baseUrl}}` = `http://localhost:3000/api/v1`.\nSelecciona el environment **RWA Local** y rellena `password` (la del seed, mínimo 12 caracteres). `email` por defecto es `admin@exchange.com`.\n\n## Flujo que debe implementar el front\n\n1. `POST /auth/login` con `{ email, password }`.\n2. Si `data.requiresTwoFactor` es `false`, guarda `data.accessToken` y `data.refreshToken`.\n3. Si es `true`, muestra la pantalla de 2FA y llama `POST /auth/2fa/verify` con `data.twoFactorToken` y el código de 6 dígitos. Ahí sí llegan los tokens.\n4. El resto de la API lleva `Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>`.\n5. Si una llamada responde 401 con el access token vencido (15 min), `POST /auth/refresh` con el `refreshToken` y reintenta. El refresh anterior queda invalidado: guarda siempre el par nuevo.\n6. `POST /auth/logout` lleva el Bearer y `{ refreshToken }`.\n\nLas peticiones de esta colección guardan solas `accessToken`, `refreshToken` y `twoFactorToken` cuando la respuesta es 2xx.\n\n## Formas de respuesta\n\nÉxito: `{ success: true, data, timestamp }`.\nError: `{ success: false, statusCode, message, path, timestamp }`. `message` puede ser string o array (validación).\n\nLogin sin 2FA está limitado a 5 intentos por minuto por IP.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "const code = pm.response.code;",
          "if (code < 200 || code >= 300 || code === 204) return;",
          "let body;",
          "try { body = pm.response.json(); } catch (e) { return; }",
          "const data = body && body.data;",
          "if (!data || typeof data !== 'object') return;",
          "function save(key, value) {",
          "  if (typeof value !== 'string' || !value) return;",
          "  pm.collectionVariables.set(key, value);",
          "  try { pm.environment.set(key, value); } catch (e) {}",
          "}",
          "save('accessToken', data.accessToken);",
          "save('refreshToken', data.refreshToken);",
          "save('twoFactorToken', data.twoFactorToken);"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000/api/v1" },
    { "key": "email", "value": "admin@exchange.com" },
    { "key": "password", "value": "" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "refreshToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "twoFactorToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "twoFactorCode", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Login",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
              "const data = pm.response.json().data;",
              "pm.test('tokens o reto 2FA', function () {",
              "  pm.expect(data.requiresTwoFactor === true || typeof data.accessToken === 'string').to.eql(true);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
        "description": "Público. Sin 2FA responde `requiresTwoFactor: false` más `accessToken` y `refreshToken`. Con 2FA activo responde `requiresTwoFactor: true` y `twoFactorToken` (no entrega tokens todavía). 401 si el email o la contraseña no coinciden, o la cuenta está bloqueada."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "Sin 2FA",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@exchange.com\",\n  \"password\": \"<password>\"\n}" },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login"
          },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"requiresTwoFactor\": false,\n    \"accessToken\": \"<jwt>\",\n    \"refreshToken\": \"<jwt>\"\n  },\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z\"\n}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Con 2FA",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@exchange.com\",\n  \"password\": \"<password>\"\n}" },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login"
          },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"requiresTwoFactor\": true,\n    \"twoFactorToken\": \"<jwt>\"\n  },\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z\"\n}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Credenciales inválidas",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@exchange.com\",\n  \"password\": \"<password>\"\n}" },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login"
          },
          "status": "Unauthorized",
          "code": 401,
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "body": "{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"statusCode\": 401,\n  \"message\": \"Credenciales inválidas\",\n  \"path\": \"/api/v1/auth/login\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z\"\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verificar 2FA",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200 y tokens', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.accessToken).to.be.a('string');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"twoFactorToken\": \"{{twoFactorToken}}\",\n  \"code\": \"{{twoFactorCode}}\"\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/2fa/verify",
        "description": "Público. Úsalo solo cuando el login devolvió `requiresTwoFactor: true`. `code` son 6 dígitos del autenticador. `twoFactorToken` caduca en 5 minutos. 401 si el código o el token no valen."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "Código correcto",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"twoFactorToken\": \"<jwt>\",\n  \"code\": \"123456\"\n}" },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/2fa/verify"
          },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"accessToken\": \"<jwt>\",\n    \"refreshToken\": \"<jwt>\"\n  },\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z\"\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Perfil (me)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
              "pm.test('email', function () {",
              "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.email).to.be.a('string');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me",
        "description": "Requiere `Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}`. Devuelve el usuario del JWT: id, email, roles, permissions y twoFactorVerified. 401 sin token o con un token que no sea de tipo access."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "Sesión válida",
          "originalRequest": { "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me" },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": \"<objectId>\",\n    \"email\": \"admin@exchange.com\",\n    \"roles\": [\"SUPER_ADMIN\"],\n    \"permissions\": [\"users:read\", \"users:write\"],\n    \"twoFactorVerified\": false\n  },\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z\"\n}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Sin token",
          "originalRequest": { "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me" },
          "status": "Unauthorized",
          "code": 401,
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "body": "{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"statusCode\": 401,\n  \"message\": \"Token inválido o expirado\",\n  \"path\": \"/api/v1/auth/me\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z\"\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Configurar 2FA",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/2fa/setup",
        "description": "Requiere Bearer. No lleva body. Devuelve `secret` y `otpauthUrl` para mostrar el QR. El 2FA queda pendiente hasta `POST /auth/2fa/enable`. 400 si ya estaba habilitado."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "Secreto generado",
          "originalRequest": { "method": "POST", "header": [], "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/2fa/setup" },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"secret\": \"<base32>\",\n    \"otpauthUrl\": \"otpauth://totp/RWA%20Exchange%20Backoffice:admin@exchange.com?secret=<base32>&issuer=RWA%20Exchange%20Backoffice\"\n  },\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z\"\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Activar 2FA",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"{{twoFactorCode}}\"\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/2fa/enable",
        "description": "Requiere Bearer. `code` es el TOTP de 6 dígitos del secreto recién generado. Al activarse se revocan los refresh tokens: el front debe volver a hacer login y pasar por `/auth/2fa/verify`."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "Activado",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"123456\"\n}" },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/2fa/enable"
          },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"enabled\": true\n  },\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z\"\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Refresh",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200 y par nuevo', function () {",
              "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "  const data = pm.response.json().data;",
              "  pm.expect(data.accessToken).to.be.a('string');",
              "  pm.expect(data.refreshToken).to.be.a('string');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh",
        "description": "Público. Rota el par de tokens. Guarda el `refreshToken` nuevo: reenviar el anterior responde 401 y revoca el resto de sesiones de ese usuario."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "Rotación",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"<jwt>\"\n}" },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh"
          },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"accessToken\": \"<jwt>\",\n    \"refreshToken\": \"<jwt>\"\n  },\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z\"\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Logout",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}",
          "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
        },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout",
        "description": "Requiere Bearer (`accessToken`) y el `refreshToken` en el body. El controlador responde 204. El front debe borrar ambos tokens en el cliente."
      },
      "response": []
    }
  ]
}
